# CMake build directories
build-*/

# Visual Studio files
.vs/

# Compiled executables and object files
*.exe
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk

build-*/
#Blender preparation tips:
1. Set your scene units to Metric.
2. Apply object scale with Ctrl + A → Scale.
3. Make sure the object origin is centered appropriately.
4. Copy of the original mesh is kept before exporting.
5. Export as .obj or .stl.


# Compile project
cmake --build build-x64

# Run simulation
.\build-x64\CerealPhysics.exe

#When adding a new .cpp file or changing CMakeLists.txt, reconfigure with:
cmake -S . -B build-x64 -G "Nmake Makefiles"